# Group Project - Games Website #
## Introduction ##
Introducing… MindSpark Games!​
Our web application allows users to play from a choice of two games – ‘Guess the word’ and ‘Maths Racing Game’. ​
‘Guess the word’ – Users pick from a category and difficulty, then have 6 guesses to guess the correct word using hints from previous guesses such as letters contained in the word.​
‘Maths Racing Game’ – Users pick from a difficulty level, then have 100 seconds to answer as many math equations correct as possible to maximise your score.​
Users can play as a guest or make an account.​
If they choose to make an account, they can then save their scores on a global leaderboard – Best streak for Guess the word and High score in Maths racing Game.​

